    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d231">

                <pb facs="0437" n="123" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg123"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1143a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Portugal</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Birch</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-28T16:00:00-05:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">October 28, 1914, 4 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Has declaration of war against Germany, or other decree indicating that a state
                    of war exists, been issued by Portuguese Government? If so, report fully by
                    telegraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
